    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Classifies the terms and conditions of an access agreement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The agreement relates to access to a declared service.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The agreement embodies any or all of the terms and conditions on which the carrier or carriage service provider is to comply with any or all of the standard access obligations applicable to the carrier or provider.";
