    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Classifies the requirements imposed by an access determination.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "If an access determination imposes requirements on a carrier or carriage service provider in relation to access to the declared service, as mentioned in paragraph 152BC(3)(e)—";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The agreement embodies any or all of the terms and conditions on which the carrier or carriage service provider is to comply with any or all of those requirements.";
