    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Classifies the terms and conditions of an access seeker's access to a declared service.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The agreement embodies any other terms and conditions of the access seeker’s access to the declared service;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The agreement requires the carrier or carriage service provider to comply with any or all of the standard access obligations applicable to the carrier or provider in a manner specified in the agreement;";
